validators.py<pre><code>from buraq.exceptions import ValidationError


def validate_no_spaces(value):
    if " " in value:
        raise ValidationError("Value cannot contain spaces.")


def validate_min_words(min_words):
    def inner(value):
        if len(value.split()) &lt; min_words:
            raise ValidationError(f"Must contain at least {min_words} words.")
    return inner
</code></pre> <p>Attach to a field:</p> <pre><code>slug    = CharField(validators=[validate_no_spaces])
content = TextField(validators=[validate_min_words(10)])
</code></pre>

